<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Owens Corning cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Owens Corning cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Salomon Brothers Inc said it downgraded Owens Corning to hold from buy.</p>
<p>-- cut the 1997 earnings estimate to $4.90 a share from $5.30 a share.</p>
<p>-- said company management told analysts is expects 1997 earnings to fall in a range between $4.85 to $5.00 a share, below the current consensus of $5.06 a share.</p>
<p>-- Owens Corning lost 7/8 to 47-1/4.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
